<title>USA: Cotati-Rohnert Park USD, Calif., won by Merrill.</title>
<headline>Cotati-Rohnert Park USD, Calif., won by Merrill.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said it won $9 million of Cotati-Rohnert Park Unified School District, Calif., general obligation capital appreciation bonds, election 1990, Series F, with a true interest cost of 6.11 percent.</p>
</text>
